WEBVTT

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:01.656
and since they make about one-third
of all the laptops on the planet today,

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:03.256
that question disappeared.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:06.496
So it's not a matter
of whether it's going to happen.

00:17:06.520 --> 00:17:07.736
It is going to happen.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:12.180
And if it comes out
at 138 dollars, so what?

00:17:12.204 --> 00:17:15.230
If it comes out six months late, so what?

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.930
That's a pretty soft landing.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.490
Thank you.

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.079
(Applause)